The space $\hat\stateSpace$ is a cone in $\hat\vecSpace$ with operations taken componentwise.

<Proof>

This is obvious, as each of the factors $\stateSpace$, $\vecSpace$, $\bbR_+$ that appear in our product is also a cone.

